{"id":"01a0657e-136b-72d0-b9a4-b324ff5cea27","chapterSlug":"rw4-04 K","paragraph":494,"wording":"[Geomancer]","event":"named","holderSlug":"geomancer-level-36","holderQuote":"Nune stared into two innocuous, watery brown eyes. You would never have thought they were the eyes of a Level 36 [Geomancer].","effectQuote":"He tapped the ground with his staff, and the earth shook."}
{"id":"01a0657e-136b-7561-82aa-0ab11d0f8452","chapterSlug":"rw4-05 K","paragraph":376,"wording":"[Geomancer]","event":"named","holderSlug":"the-geomancer","claimed":true,"claimedBySlug":"flos","holderQuote":"“I fear…I may have been outmatched. By a single [Geomancer], no less.”"}
{"id":"01a0657e-136b-7e4f-afb8-5da753beffed","chapterSlug":"rw4-05 K","paragraph":446,"wording":"[Geomancer]","event":"named","holderSlug":"the-geomancer","holderQuote":"The [Mage]. The [Geomancer] watched Mars racing towards him, eyes narrowed. She struck the first line of soldiers with a clash that Trey heard even from a distance. Mars’ shield swung like a mace, edge striking a man’s face and caving it in. Her sword flashed, and two warriors stumbled back, falling. But she didn’t stop."}
{"id":"01a0657e-136b-7cb2-b60f-aa2b70a0c5fb","chapterSlug":"rw4-05 K","paragraph":453,"wording":"[Geomancer]","event":"named","holderSlug":"the-geomancer","holderQuote":"Flos’ voice was quiet. He was watching Mars as she cut through a group of soldiers trying to protect the [Geomancer]. And he was right."}
